    "description": {
      "value": "<div data-ft-phase5-vocab-scrub=\"v1\" style=\"display:none\"></div>\n<p><strong>Anomaly Backtrace.</strong> You are disturbingly good at reconstructing the chain of events that produced a glitch.</p><ul><li>When you spend at least 10 minutes examining the aftermath of a <strong>Spark event, Tikkun shift, hex mutation, or Qliphothic incident</strong>, you can make an <strong>Occult (Mind), Investigation (Mind), or Insight (Soul)</strong> check (GM sets DC).</li><li>On a success, you can reconstruct a rough <strong>cause chain:</strong> who or what triggered this, what layer it came from (mundane, factional, Tikkun, Qliphothic), and at least one actionable clue about how to <strong>repeat, avoid, or repair</strong> it.</li></ul><p>Mechanically, this is a narrative tool for feeding the party useful “debug info” in complicated situations.</p>",
